#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.pca.rst:2
msgid "qfeval\\_functions.functions.pca"
msgstr "qfeval\\_functions.functions.pca"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:1
msgid "Compute Principal Component Analysis (PCA) on the input data."
msgstr "入力データに対して主成分分析（PCA）を実行します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:3
msgid ""
"This function performs PCA by computing the covariance matrix of the "
"input data and then finding its principal components through singular "
"value decomposition (SVD). The principal components are ordered by their "
"explained variance in descending order."
msgstr "この関数は主成分分析（PCA）を実行します。まず、入力データの共分散行列を計算し、次に特異値分解（SVD）を用いてその主成分を求めます。主成分は、説明される分散の大きさに基づいて降順に並べ替えられます。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:8
msgid ""
"PCA is a dimensionality reduction technique that finds the directions of "
"maximum variance in high-dimensional data and projects the data onto a "
"lower-dimensional subspace formed by these principal components."
msgstr "主成分分析（PCA）は、高次元データにおいて最大の分散を示す方向を特定し、これらの主成分によって形成される低次元部分空間にデータを投影する次元削減手法です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.pca.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:13
msgid ""
"Input data of shape ``(..., S, D)`` where ``S`` is the number of samples "
"and ``D`` is the number of features/dimensions. The batch dimensions "
"``...`` are preserved."
msgstr "入力データの形状は ``(..., S, D)`` で、``S`` はサンプル数、``D`` は特徴量/次元数を表します。バッチ次元 ``...`` は保持されます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.pca.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:18
msgid ""
"A dataclass containing:  - **components** (*Tensor*): Principal component"
" vectors of shape   ``(..., D, D)``. Each row ``components[..., i, :]`` "
"represents   the i-th principal component direction. - "
"**explained_variance** (*Tensor*): Explained variance ratios of   shape "
"``(..., D)`` corresponding to each principal component,   ordered from "
"largest to smallest."
msgstr "以下の属性を含むデータクラス:  - **components** (*Tensor*): 主成分ベクトルの形状は   ``(..., D, D)``。各行 ``components[..., i, :]`` は   i番目の主成分方向を表します。 - **explained_variance** (*Tensor*): 形状 ``(..., D)`` の主成分ごとの説明分散比。   分散比は降順に並べ替えられています。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:18
msgid "A dataclass containing:"
msgstr "以下の属性を含むデータクラス:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:20
msgid ""
"**components** (*Tensor*): Principal component vectors of shape ``(..., "
"D, D)``. Each row ``components[..., i, :]`` represents the i-th principal"
" component direction."
msgstr "**components** (*Tensor*): 主成分ベクトルの形状は ``(..., D, D)`` です。各行 ``components[..., i, :]`` は第 i 主成分の方向ベクトルを表します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:23
msgid ""
"**explained_variance** (*Tensor*): Explained variance ratios of shape "
"``(..., D)`` corresponding to each principal component, ordered from "
"largest to smallest."
msgstr "**explained_variance** (*Tensor*): 各主成分に対応する説明分散比のテンソルで、形状は``(..., D)``。説明分散比は各主成分について、降順に並べ替えられています。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.pca.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:29
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:49
msgid ":func:`pca_cov`: Compute PCA from a precomputed covariance matrix."
msgstr ":func:`pca_cov`: 事前計算された共分散行列からPCAを計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:52
msgid ""
"In financial applications, dimensions often represent different assets or"
" features, while samples represent time periods or observations."
msgstr "金融アプリケーションにおいて、次元は通常異なる資産や特徴を表し、サンプルは時間期間や観測値を表します。"

